  "description": "The IpgKit operator console: transactions, refunds, payment links, payment methods, webhooks and subscriptions, catalog, reports, audit and configuration, plus the operator sign-in pages and the admin user seeder. The hosted card page and the citizen account pages are NOT here - they ship as OrleIndustries.IpgKit.Web.Pay and OrleIndustries.IpgKit.Web.Customer so a citizen-facing deployment does not carry the operator console. Consume via AddIpgKitAdmin / UseIpgKitAdmin.",
